{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39987","headline":"病中春日即事寄主人尚书二首 二 · 徐夤","name":"病中春日即事寄主人尚书二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风拍衰肌久未蠲，破窗频见月团圆。\n更无旧日同人问，只有多情太守怜。\n腊内送将三折股，岁阴分与五铢钱。\n玄穹若假年龄在，愿捧铜盘爲国贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}